1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,020
Buat lo yang mau beli akun

2
00:00:01,070 --> 00:00:02,720
Claude sharing karena lebih murah,

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:04,180
tonton video ini sampai habis.

4
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:05,540
Ada beberapa risiko yang wajib lo

5
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:06,640
tahu sebelum beli.

6
00:00:06,690 --> 00:00:07,240
Pertama,

7
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:08,500
soal limit penggunaan.

8
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:09,100
Misalnya,

9
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:10,520
satu akun Claude pro seharga 20

10
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:12,080
dolar dipakai 5 orang.

11
00:00:12,130 --> 00:00:13,540
Memang kalau dibagi rata,

12
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:15,360
biayanya cuma 4 dolar per orang.

13
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:17,980
Tapi penggunaan kalian berbagi kapasitas akun

14
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:18,900
yang sama.

15
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:20,680
Kalau pengguna lain lebih banyak memakai

16
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:21,460
Claude-nya,

17
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:23,800
lo bisa lebih cepat habis limitnya.

18
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:24,340
Kedua,

19
00:00:24,390 --> 00:00:26,300
soal memori dan konteks pekerjaan.

20
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:27,160
Bayangin,

21
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:29,080
lu pakai Claude buat penelitian,

22
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,960
sementara pengguna lain memakainya buat coding

23
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:32,060
atau bisnis.

24
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:33,600
Claude punya fitur memori dan bisa

25
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:36,080
menggunakan konteks dari pekerjaan sebelumnya.

26
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:37,900
Kalau informasi yang tersedia nggak relevan,

27
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:40,120
jawabannya berpotensi kurang sesuai dengan kebutuhan

28
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:40,700
lu.

29
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:41,280
Ketiga,

30
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:43,020
