33
00:00:45,990 --> 00:00:47,720
itu berisiko diakses pengguna lain,

34
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:50,040
apalagi kalau itu ada data-data penting.

35
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:51,800
Jadi akun sharing emang lebih hemat

36
00:00:51,850 --> 00:00:52,640
dan lebih murah,

37
00:00:52,690 --> 00:00:54,440
tapi lu juga perlu mempertimbangkan soal

38
00:00:54,490 --> 00:00:55,000
limit,

39
00:00:55,050 --> 00:00:56,380
privasi dan kenyamanan kerja.

40
00:00:56,430 --> 00:00:57,080
So,

41
00:00:57,130 --> 00:00:57,940
buat pekerjaan serius,

42
00:00:57,990 --> 00:00:59,320
akun pribadi itu jelas,

43
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:00,620
jauh lebih ideal.

44
00:01:00,670 --> 00:01:02,030
Thank you.
